{
  "name": "dsh-agent-team-router",
  "version": "2.0.0",
  "description": "Agent Team Router —— DSH (DeepSeek Harness) 插件：把任务文本路由为合适的多角色团队编制，并管理团队调度、分层 DAG 依赖、关键路径/并行度分析、多 Agent 协作协议（handoff/inbox）与 5 阶段质量门禁。内置 297 角色（集成 agency-agents 273 专业角色 + 精选中文域角色，含课程设计/教学教研/培训讲师等教研域角色）。",
  "main": "index.js",
  "type": "commonjs",
  "files": [
    "index.js",
    "router.js",
    "team.js",
    "roles.json",
    "cordis.patch.yml",
    "tools/build-roles.js",
    "README.md",
    "LICENSE"
  ],
  "scripts": {
    "test": "node test/smoke.js"
  },
  "keywords": [
    "dsh",
    "deepseek-harness",
    "cordis",
    "agent",
    "team",
    "router",
    "multi-agent",
    "orchestration"
  ],
  "author": "fjzzwxp",
  "license": "MIT",
  "peerDependencies": {
    "@deepseek-ai/dsh-tools": "*",
    "@deepseek-ai/cordis": "*"
  },
  "dsh": {
    "bundle": {
      "patch": "./cordis.patch.yml"
    }
  }
}
